$\begin{aligned}& \text{ Hints }: \sin A \sin B=\frac{a b}{c^2}\\
& \Rightarrow c²=\frac{a b}{\sin A \sin B}= \left(\frac{a}{\sin A}\right)\left(\frac{b}{\sin B}\right) \\
& \Rightarrow c^2=\ \left(\frac{c}{\sin C}\right)^2 \Rightarrow \sin ^2 C=1 \Rightarrow \sin C=1 \Rightarrow C=90^{{}^{\circ}}
\end{aligned}
$
